        },
        {
          "text": "Nũũ ũla ũtonya kũũngama mbee wa ũthilĩku wake? Na nũũ ũla ũtonya kwĩkala wainĩ wa ũthatu wake? Ũthilĩku wake nĩ mwonosye ta mwaki, na mavia manene nĩmatũanganĩtw’e nĩwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.1.6",
